          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. What It Is",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Everyone integrates into ==one main branch== (trunk) at least **daily**",
                "Trunk is {green:always releasable}",
                "Core metric: ==integration frequency==",
                "Branches live {green:hours to ~2 days}, never weeks"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Merging Is Not Releasing",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Small commit",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Merge to trunk",
                    "sub": "flag off",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Deploy",
                    "sub": "dark",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Flag on",
                    "sub": "release",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Trunk-Based vs GitFlow",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Trunk-based",
                "GitFlow"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Long-lived branches",
                  "**1** (trunk)",
                  "main, develop, release, hotfix"
                ],
                [
                  "Feature branches",
                  "hours to ~2 days",
                  "until finished"
                ],
                [
                  "Unfinished work",
                  "behind flags",
                  "held on branch"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Needs ==fast automated tests== on every commit",
                "Broken trunk: {red:fix or revert first}, before anything else"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Merging never means releasing: ==feature flags== keep unfinished work dark, and a branch left for weeks defeats trunk-based."
