    {
      "title": "Short-Lived Feature Branches in Practice",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 1,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Short-Lived Feature Branches in Practice",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. The Daily Cycle",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Cycle: ==branch from fresh main==, commit small, open PR, merge, **delete branch same day**",
                "Keep PRs ==200-400 lines==: small diffs review fast and conflict rarely",
                "Rebase before merging: keeps history ==linear=="
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "bash",
              "lines": [
                "git switch main && git pull",
                "git switch -c feat/x",
                "git fetch origin && git rebase origin/main"
              ],
              "note": "start fresh, then sync before the PR merges"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Merging",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Squash merge",
                "Result"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Trunk history",
                  "one commit per change"
                ],
                [
                  "Undo a change",
                  "single `git revert <sha>`"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Big Refactors",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Branch by abstraction== or a **feature flag** splits a refactor into steps",
                "Each step merges safely and ships dark"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Add abstraction",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Move callers",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "New impl behind flag",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Remove old",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Mistake: drifting branch",
              "text": "A long-running branch drifts and ends in a painful merge. ==Sync main daily== or merge in **slices**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "GitFlow and Why It Slows CI",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "GitFlow and Why It Slows CI",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. The Five Branch Types",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Branch",
                "Role"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`main`",
                  "releases only"
                ],
                [
                  "`develop`",
                  "integration"
                ],
                [
                  "`feature/*`",
                  "one per feature, off develop"
                ],
                [
                  "`release/*`",
                  "stabilize before shipping"
                ],
                [
                  "`hotfix/*`",
                  "urgent fix, off main"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Why CI Slows Down",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "feature/*",
                    "sub": "merges when finished",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "develop",
                    "sub": "late integration",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "release/*",
                    "sub": "stabilization",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "main",
                    "sub": "tag and ship",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Features merge ==late==, so integration is delayed and conflicts pile up",
                "CI runs on every long-lived branch: more pipeline runs, ==duplicate builds==",
                "Stabilization gate: commit to production takes ==days or weeks=="
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Hotfix double merge",
              "text": "Merge into ==both main and develop==. Forget one and the bug returns."
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Fit and Interview Point",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "{green:Fits}: ==versioned, multi-release== products (installed software)",
                "{red:Poor fit}: continuous deployment of web services"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Why is GitFlow slow?** Late merges, many branches to build, a release gate",
                "**Biggest hotfix risk?** Skipping the merge back to develop",
                "**Better for web services?** Trunk-based development"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "blue"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
